[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5042.149, "timestamp": "01:24:02", "text": "听说过。你之前提过吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5044.31, "timestamp": "01:24:04", "text": "大部头书？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5047.669, "timestamp": "01:24:07", "text": "不，我不知道。但它只有 270。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5049.51, "timestamp": "01:24:09", "text": "有个优惠。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5054.11, "timestamp": "01:24:14", "text": "它上个月，也就是29号发布的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5056.91, "timestamp": "01:24:16", "text": "可能。就像《逆转裁判》那种类型的游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5059.75, "timestamp": "01:24:19", "text": "东西。你可以拥有你的朋友，一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5063.189, "timestamp": "01:24:23", "text": "他们之中有人担任法官，有人担任三名法官。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5067.59, "timestamp": "01:24:27", "text": "就像专业法律人士，比如检察官或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5069.75, "timestamp": "01:24:29", "text": "某物。是的。那些争论的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5072.87, "timestamp": "01:24:32", "text": "并进行辩论。是的。真的很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5075.229, "timestamp": "01:24:35", "text": "太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5078.55, "timestamp": "01:24:38", "text": "是的。法庭一片混乱。指控或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5084.39, "timestamp": "01:24:44", "text": "我能……我的天哪。我已经可以点赞了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5086.629, "timestamp": "01:24:46", "text": "看起来大家都对此反应过度了。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5090.99, "timestamp": "01:24:50", "text": "这又是一个绝妙的主意。是的，的确如此。"}]